### 1. Update Page Status
```bash
NOTION_KEY="ntn_1234567890abcdef"

curl -X PATCH "https://api.notion.com/v1/pages/abc-123-def-456" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $NOTION_KEY" \
  -H "Notion-Version: 2025-09-03" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "properties": {
      "Status": {
        "select": {
          "name": "Reviewed"
        }
      }
    }
  }'
```

